    "title": "Check out 5 Sugar Land, Missouri City nonprofit features from 2025 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aubrey Vogel ,\n13 hours ago In December, Asha's Food Bank organized donation drives at drives at Don Cook Natatorium, Clements High School, and Fort Settlement Middle School. (Courtesy Asha's Food Bank) Throughout 2025, Community Impact spoke with directors and volunteers of five local nonprofits to be featured in our monthly editions. Here’s a look back at the Sugar Land and Missouri City organizations we featured. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
